commit dd6ed9447096abec30a358d987f1d0b62446c28e
Author: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>
Date:   Mon Jan 19 19:00:02 2026 +1100

    Allow setting of the new SPICE debug_logging option.
    
    This emits debug logs to the libvirt qemu log if enabled, which
    can be helpful when debugging connnectivity issues.
    
    Change-Id: I0a19e9e18bba014f12ec97d5fd44f3b624a3f8aa
    Signed-off-by: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>

